<title>USA: Sundstrand chairman retires, successor named.</title>
<headline>Sundstrand chairman retires, successor named.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sundstrand Corp said Tuesday that Don O'Hare, 74, chairman of the board, will retire effective with the close of business today.</p>
<p>The board also elected Robert Jenkins to the additional position of chairman.  Jenkins had been president and chief executive officer since joining Sundstrand in late 1995.</p>
<p>Sundstrand makes and markets components and sub-systems for aerospace and industrial markets.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
